ions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T13:24:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T13:24:45Z","body":"For the record, I noticed there's a `build_raw_header` I forgot to handle in this PR.\r\n\r\nBut I gave it a try now and it saves practically no size on a template, as the main shaders are used  by `betsy` and `lightmapper_rd` (editor only). There are also `_inc.glsl` files built as \"raw\" shaders but they don't seem to make up much.\r\n\r\nOn the editor build, it saves around 120 KiB, which isn't a lot for the added boilerplate, so I'm not sure it's worth the trouble.\r\n\r\nI also switched the compression of RD and GLES3 shaders to zstd but that didn't save much on either template or editor (20 KiB).\r\n\r\nHere's the code for reference: https://github.com/akien-mga/godot/tree/size-compress-shaders-zstd-all","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6169398205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]